indie_pop_music(phoenix). @ "Phoneix's music is classified under the indie pop genre."
band(phoenix). @ "Phoenix is a band from France."
from_france(phoenix). @ "Phoenix is a band from France."
band(V) & from_france(V) => writes_in_french(V) | writes_in_english(V). @ "French bands write songs in French or in English."
not writes_in_french(phoenix). @ "Phoenix has no songs in French."
? writes_in_french(phoenix).
